WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.697
Every air app gives you a number.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:07.942
But a number doesn't know who lives in your
house.

00:00:07.982 --> 00:00:10.674
That your father has asthma.

00:00:10.714 --> 00:00:13.703
That your kitchen runs on gas.

00:00:13.743 --> 00:00:16.951
That your daughter walks to school at eight.

00:00:17.018 --> 00:00:19.002
AirMitra does.

00:00:19.042 --> 00:00:25.357
It's a household air coach for India
— all twenty-eight states and eight union territories.

00:00:25.686 --> 00:00:28.237
Choose your language first.

00:00:28.277 --> 00:00:31.745
Thirteen Indian languages — the interface,

00:00:31.785 --> 00:00:34.708
the brief, and every answer follow.

00:00:34.978 --> 00:00:40.976
It starts with the live reading: CPCB, OpenAQ,
the nearest live monitors,

00:00:41.016 --> 00:00:44.565
and a model only when nothing else is close.

00:00:44.605 --> 00:00:49.414
Every number shows its source, its distance,
and its age.

00:00:49.454 --> 00:00:54.119
Gemini turns that into one clear directive:
what to do,

00:00:54.159 --> 00:00:57.405
why, and what to do if you must go out.

00:00:57.445 --> 00:01:01.672
If the model is busy, rules return the same
shape.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:06.241
Ask it anything — is it safe for my father to
walk now?

00:01:06.281 --> 00:01:11.462
and the answer uses the live air, his asthma,
and your routine.

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:13.488
Want to share?

00:01:13.528 --> 00:01:18.970
It builds a high-quality story card with your
best hours, three actions,

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:24.340
the impact, and one way to give back — ready
to share on social media.

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:26.368
No accounts.

00:01:26.408 --> 00:01:28.508
No analytics.

00:01:28.548 --> 00:01:31.678
Your profile stays on your device.

00:01:31.718 --> 00:01:33.533
No ads.

00:01:33.573 --> 00:01:35.660
No data sold.

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:40.505
AirMitra — because clean air advice should
know your home.

00:01:40.545 --> 00:01:44.347
Live at airmitra-app dot vercel dot app.
